        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Olympia Dukakis, Norman Jewison, John Patrick Shanley, George T. Miller, Sigrid Thornton\n- Films: Moonstruck, Over the Hill\n- Awards: Academy Award, Golden Globe, BAFTA\n\nFacts:\n- Moonstruck is a 1987 American romantic comedy film directed by Norman Jewison and written by John Patrick Shanley.\n- In 1987, Olympia Dukakis won an Academy Award and a Golden Globe and received a BAFTA nomination for her performance in Moonstruck.\n- Over the Hill is a 1992 Australian drama film directed by George T. Miller and starring Olympia Dukakis and Sigrid Thornton.",
